# Play Integrity Fix ("Custom Tweaks").
# Snapshot the switch at boot: the framework hooks and the tb520fu-input-custom
# keybox service read only the sys.* snapshots, so a change needs a restart.
# Unset persist properties (fresh install, factory reset) mean on, so the
# feature is enabled by default; the app writes an explicit 0 or 1 when used.
on boot
    setprop sys.tb520fu.integrity_keybox ${persist.sys.tb520fu.integrity_keybox:-1}
    setprop sys.tb520fu.integrity_teesim ${persist.sys.tb520fu.integrity_teesim:-1}
    setprop sys.tb520fu.integrity_pif ${persist.sys.tb520fu.integrity_pif:-1}
